WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
Oh God, oh God, oh God! (laughs)

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.600
(both screams)

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.464
What's happening?!
[Moses] There he is!

00:00:08.464 --> 00:00:10.590
(Conan laughs)

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:12.200
Yes!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.033
Yes!

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:15.533
(Deon laughs)

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.451
(Deon laughs)
No!

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.320
No!
COVID!

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.641
No? Oh, right.

00:00:21.641 --> 00:00:22.474
You can't do that.

00:00:22.474 --> 00:00:24.100
You have to lick with the mask on.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:24.933
With the mask on?

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:26.930
[Moses] Yeah, it's a myriad of reasons.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.540
How you guys doing?

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.420
[Deon] What's up Conan?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.057
[Conan] How are you?

00:00:33.057 --> 00:00:35.150
[Deon] Whatcha doing buddy?

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:38.710
Well, you know, just going over my notes.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.950
Whatever, just grinding it out,
just trying to grind it out.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:43.410
[Moses] That's what people say.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:44.910
[Deon] Nice coat!

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:45.743
Right?

00:00:45.743 --> 00:00:46.700
[Deon] Nice.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:47.533
[Conan] Right there.

00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:48.366
[Deon] Jeez.

00:00:48.366 --> 00:00:51.099
Red Baron.
(Deon laughs)

00:00:51.099 --> 00:00:52.436
[Deon] Yeah, that's what I'll do in it.

00:00:52.436 --> 00:00:53.630
(Deon and Sona laugh)

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:57.213
Like a biplane in here
from the Truman era.

